			<span class="sbi-screenreader">EYES ON THE SEAM 👀⚾️  Mastering the focus catch is</span>
						<svg style="color: rgba(255,255,255,1)" class="svg-inline--fa fa-play fa-w-14 sbi_playbtn" aria-label="Play" aria-hidden="true" data-fa-processed="" data-prefix="fa" data-icon="play" role="presentation" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M424.4 214.7L72.4 6.6C43.8-10.3 0 6.1 0 47.9V464c0 37.5 40.7 60.1 72.4 41.3l352-208c31.4-18.5 31.5-64.1 0-82.6z"></path></svg>			<img decoding="async" data-src="https://theacademybaseball.com/wp-content/plugins/instagram-feed/img/placeholder.png" alt="EYES ON THE SEAM 👀⚾️

